        "content": "## Setup\n1. Import `image-generator.json` first, publish it, copy its workflow ID into **Generate Image**.\n2. Create credentials: Telegram (BotFather token), Gemini API key, Gmail OAuth2 x2, Postgres, Cloudflare (Header Auth).\n3. **Telegram Message** -> Restrict to User IDs -> your numeric Telegram ID.\n4. Replace `YOUR_TELEGRAM_USER_ID` and the example email addresses.\n5. n8n needs a public HTTPS URL (WEBHOOK_URL) for the Telegram webhook.\n6. Publish.",
